{"articleNo":"128394","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=128394&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016 호주 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.05.06","hit":"3359","attachments":[{"name":"summary of endeavour scholarships and fellowships.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=128394&attachNo=73537"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#3d0099\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2016 호주 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내하오니</span></font></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#3d0099\">관심있는 학생들의&nbsp;많은 지원&nbsp;바랍니다.</font></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 장학금명 : Endeavour Scholarships and Fellowships</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 장학금 규모</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1) 학비, 생활비, 정착비용 및 여행 경비 지원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2) 국가별 쿼터는 없으며 우수 인재 우선 선발</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다. 신청방법</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1) Endeavour Scholarships and Fellowships 웹사이트 접속</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2) 해당 장학금 절차 및 준비서류 확인</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3) 서류 준비</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4) <strong><u>6.30(화)까지 온라인 신청</u></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">라. 합격자 발표 : 12월 말 개별 통보</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">마. 웹사이트 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.endeavourawards.or.kr/\">http://www.endeavourawards.or.kr/</a></span><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.endeavourawards.or.kr/\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></a></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">바. 기타 세부 사항은 웹사이트 및 [붙임] 안내 자료 참조</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">사. 문의처 : 주한호주대사관 교육부, 02-2003-0102</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">붙임 : 2016 호주 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
